# paperscale-scale env: F_9 per-leakage-point pbw (default mode), low noise.
#
# Pairs with .env_paperscale_per_leakpoint (realistic noise) to test whether
# the bit-identical SR observed at smoke between σ=0.0007 and σ=0.01 also
# holds at paperscale (400 training sets, 1000 SASCA traces). If yes, the
# noise-axis sensitivity is fully a model-mismatch artefact at paperscale.

